sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App
    participant Files
    participant Broker
    User->>App: Capture inspected message or open template
    App->>User: Draft: body, properties, variables; no broker mutation
    User->>App: Edit and Save
    App->>Files: Write shared template; external Git handles sharing
    User->>App: Choose single values or CSV and mapping
    App->>Files: Read bounded input snapshot
    App->>User: Validate all rows; freeze values and MessageIds
    User->>App: Select destination and send/schedule mode
    App->>Broker: Encoded-size preflight only; no send
    App->>User: Review exact target, payloads, count and due time
    User->>App: Confirm Send or Schedule
    App->>Broker: Sequential send OR schedule at one common instant
    Broker->>App: Acknowledged / failed / unknown; schedule receipts
    App->>User: Per-row results; Stop leaves later rows unattempted
    User->>App: Select eligible receipts; confirm cancellation
    App->>Broker: Cancel sequentially against captured endpoint/entity
    Broker->>App: Acknowledged / failed / unknown; activation may race
    App->>User: Preserve dispatch plus attempt history; Export / View
